    "note": "OpenMU VersionSeasonSix (KanturuRuins.cs:434): level 93, 38500 life, 470-505, 370, 645/220. Raised past Aida (decision 3): two above the Blade Hunter, its numbers the Splinter Wolf's times OpenMU's ratio between the two (life 2.41, damage 1.52/1.49, defense 1.61); ranges and speeds as MU but its reach: attack range 5, as the Iron Rider's and our archers', for the arrows MU looses (OpenMU 1; the user, 2026-10-23: \"if its a range monsters it has to be range monster\"). Ours (2026-10-23). Retuned 2026-10-25 for geared level-400 heroes (the user: a step harder than Aida, a steady climb from the camp): life 103,500 (Wolf) to 138,000 (Genocider), damage 1,250 to 1,680, defence 620 to 700, levels and rates kept -- about 1.3x Aida's typical time to kill on average, measured with the best pre-Kanturu kits (a scratch skill_sweep at each nest). The defence MU's scale gave (780 to 1,747) left melee and bows at the damage floor."
  },
  "why_this_one": "The Ruins' fifth breed: 13 OpenMU spots in the north (x 72-181, y 15-71), past the Blade Hunters; the second archer, its multishot ranged as the port's decision 9 asked (docs/worlds/kanturu-port.md 4.1, 4.4).",
